{"title": "Transfuse Health", "pageid": 14444, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Transfuse_Health", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Bugs", "Illithid Powers", "Sources of healing"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Transfuse_Health.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Transfuse_Health.webp/300px-Transfuse_Health.webp, /w/images/c/c4/Transfuse_Health.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Transfuse_Health.webp/300px-Transfuse_Health.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Transfuse_Health.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Transfuse Health</b> is an action and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>. This ability allows the character to heal a target by half the caster's current hit point value.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSacrifice half your remaining hit points to heal a target for the same amount.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_TAD_TransfuseHealth</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TAD_TransfuseHealth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_TAD_TransfuseHealth\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid\">Illithid</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithid</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Full-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Illithid\">Full-Illithid</a>\n</p><p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a></li>\n<li>Obtained automatically after becoming a Partial-Illithid</li>\n<li>Obtained automatically after becoming a Full-Illithid</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Affects any entity (except Undead) — including party members, allies, enemies, and inanimate objects — so long as they have a hit point value.</li>\n<li>The damage dealt to oneself can break <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a>.</li>\n<li>Does not take into account <b>Temporary Hit Points</b> when calculating the heal amount, but it will deduct them when hurting the caster. For example, having a character with 50 Hit Points and 10 <b>Temporary Hit Points</b> use <b>Transfuse Health</b> on an ally will heal them for 25 Hit Points, and will damage the caster by 25, reducing their Hit Point value to 35.</li>\n<li>This skill is particularly noteworthy due to the fact that it is the only heal action in the game that can heal <i>any</i> entity (not Undead). There are some quests in the game (such as <a href=\"/wiki/Lift_the_Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Lift the Shadow Curse\">Lift the Shadow Curse</a>) where you are supposed to defend inanimate objects from an onslaught of enemies, and this skill can \"heal\" the object in question.</li>\n<li>This skill does not damage the user if used within a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/25px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/38px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/50px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Globe of Invulnerability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/25px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\">Globe of Invulnerability</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Some damage riders such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a> and radiant damage from the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\">Callous Glow Ring</a> increase the self-damage.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034124\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2551/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29553/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14077/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1368991/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   58.361      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   58.361      1 -total\n 61.80%   36.064     32 Template:Trim\n 18.86%   11.007      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.80%    7.469      1 Template:Resource\n 12.23%    7.136      4 Template:Icon_text\n 10.89%    6.354      1 Template:SmCond\n 10.67%    6.227      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.60%    6.185      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.42%    6.082      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:14444-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034124 and revision id 370493. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}